    "description": "<p>Ration Packs are compact meals that take up little room (You can fit six in a pouch designed to carry a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Datapad\" title=\"Datapad\">Datapad</a>), but have all the requirements to nourish a person for one day. Each Ration Pack is geared for a range of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a>. The food isn't appetizing, and it doesn't include water, but it does prevent malnutrition. </p>",
